# External side-effect boundary

Real SRO mutation is prohibited. Do not run `--live`, click Save/Send, or click Add if it may create a draft. Use an isolated fake platform for write behavior. Unknown outcomes must be reconciled read-only and must never be automatically resubmitted.

# WebForms automation

- Use stable element IDs documented in `memory-bank/30-integrations.md`; labels are ambiguous.
- Add selectors to named dictionaries in `sro_robot/platform/pages.py`, not scattered inline selectors, unless the adapter is intentionally isolated.
- After postbacks, wait for settling and reacquire locators.
- Prefer direct URLs over duplicate menu links.
- Scope address-dialog Save separately from the person-card Save.
- Never click Add only to inspect a form; it may create a draft. Inspect an already-open card or use an isolated test fixture.
- Verify network reachability from the actual user/VPS IP before diagnosing connection refusal as a code defect.
